===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Squirtle|24}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*'''Tail Whap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Wooper|66}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
